FlashCache unit tests
=====================

Requirements: cmake, a C++17 compiler, libaio, and googletest/googlemock
(libgtest-dev libgmock-dev). jemalloc is built from deps/ automatically.

Build and run, from the repository root:

    make -C src test-storage

That builds libflashcache.a and the unitTests binary, then runs the suite
through deps/gtest-parallel. Filter with UNIT_TEST_PATTERN=IndexTest.

If googletest is not installed system-wide, export
CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/path/to/googletest before running make.

Run one test under gdb:

    gdb --args deps/flashcache/build/tst/unit/unitTests --gtest_filter=<test-name>
